{"id":"n66237-4-3","stage":0,"title":"무슨 · 什么","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66237-4-3-1","ko":"술 냄새가 나는데 또 술 마신 거 아냐?","zh":"有酒味啊，该不会又喝酒了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"술","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냄새가","meaning":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","explanation":"냄새：气味，味道，香味，臭味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"냄새","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58180","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는데","meaning":"发出，泛出，响出，有","explanation":"나다：发出，泛出，响出，有；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"또","meaning":"还","explanation":"또：还","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"8","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"술","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마신","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아냐?","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"a67d0d1b921d4bc4","term":"냄새","zh":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3","entryId":"58180","definition":"能用鼻子闻到的味儿。","pronunciation":["냄ː새"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出，泛出，响出，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生能察觉到的声音或气味等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"还","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"表示对于前句的内容进行否定或觉得奇怪。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"以为","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实，认为或觉得如此。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8d66886a78bafe6ff930.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66237-4-3-2","ko":"대낮부터 무슨 술입니까?","zh":"大白天的喝什么酒啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대낮부터","meaning":"白天，大白天","explanation":"대낮：白天，大白天；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"대낮","audio":"/audio/9879eda1acbe734c8f4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14278","senseId":"1","lemma":"대낮","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"4","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"술입니까?","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니까